# The Dockerfile copies the whole build context into the image with `COPY . .`.
# The tests and their settings are for CI and a developer's machine; they have
# no business in the image that serves members, and neither do bytecode caches
# built by whatever Python happened to run them last.
tests/
pytest.ini
requirements-test.txt
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
